      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we have a massive problem. A memo just leaked about the candidate's vote against the community center funding bill from three years ago. The local news is already circling. If we admit they voted against it, our favorability is going to tank before the primary. What's our move here? How do we spin this so it doesn't look like they were just anti-community?",
